[gd_scene load_steps=2 format=3]

; The operator's coat, hanging on the hall rack by the south door.
;
; The Blender garment (including joined sleeves) follows a settled Verlet cage.
; The simulation reacts to the player and door without changing the authored cut.
;
; The transform is identity on purpose: the coat's position is expressed in room
; coordinates by coat_x / coat_z and by PROFILE's absolute heights, the same
; world-space convention OfficeStorytellingProps uses.

